            "command": "gh pr create --title \"feat: #19 - Open submenu items for the operations department for contracts\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\nThis PR implements a dropdown submenu structure for the Operations department menu, similar to the Finance department's country-based organization. The Operations menu now contains two submenu items: \"Contratos Colombia - Solicitar\" and \"Contratos M\u00e9xico - Solicitar\".\n\n## Implementation Plan\n\nSee full plan: [specs/20251124_operations_contracts_submenu.md](specs/20251124_operations_contracts_submenu.md)\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### Frontend Components\n- **FKSidebarWithCollapse.tsx**: New collapsible sidebar component supporting nested menu items with expand/collapse functionality\n- **OperationsContractsColombia.tsx**: Migrated existing contracts generation functionality (previously at /operations/contracts)\n- **OperationsContractsMexico.tsx**: New placeholder page for Mexico contracts (future implementation)\n- **App.tsx**: Updated routing to support new submenu structure with redirects\n\n### Key Features\n- \u2705 Collapsible submenu with smooth Material-UI transitions\n- \u2705 Redirect from old `/operations/contracts` route to new Colombia-specific route\n- \u2705 Role-based access control preserved (operations, admin, manager roles)\n- \u2705 Consistent Finkargo design system theming\n- \u2705 Scalable structure for future Operations functionality\n\n### Routes\n- `/operations/contracts/colombia` - Colombia contracts generation (migrated)\n- `/operations/contracts/mexico` - Mexico contracts placeholder\n- `/operations/contracts` \u2192 redirects to Colombia\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Submenu expands/collapses correctly\n- [x] Colombia contracts page loads with existing functionality\n- [x] Mexico placeholder page displays\n- [x] Route redirects work as expected\n- [x] Role-based access control maintained\n\nCloses #19\n\n**ADW ID:** a5abea9b\nEOF\n)\" --base master",
